OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and a
OL,7,Ffew bright intervals. Chance of the
OL,8,Fodd light shower. Light and variable
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening and night will
OL,12,Fsee variable amounts of cloud and some
OL,13,Fclear periods. It will be mainly dry
OL,14,Fbut still with the chance of a light
OL,15,Fshower.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FMostly dry with variable
OL,18,Famounts of cloud and just the odd
OL,19,Flight passing shower. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
